bind Identify Effect Opportunity: Opportunity Identifier
bind Perform Due Diligence: Opportunity Identifier, Hazard Degree
bind Secure Funding: Investor Identifier, Investment Amount
bind Measure Effect: Effect Metric
bind Distribute Returns: Expected ROI, Investor Identifier
bind Collect Response: Stakeholder Response
bind Exit Investment: Exit Strategy
bind Assess Efficiency: Efficiency Rating
Opportunity Identifier: integer between 1 and 99999
Expected ROI: float between 0 and 100
Hazard Degree: Reduced, Moderate, Elevated
Investor Identifier: integer between 1 and 9999
Investment Type: Equity, Debt, Grant
Investment Amount: float between 1000 and 10000000
Effect Metric: Societal, Ecological, Economic
Stakeholder Response: Favorable, Impartial, Unfavorable
Exit Strategy: Acquisition, Public Offering, Liquidation
Efficiency Rating: integer between 1 and 10
Init[Identify Effect Opportunity] | |
Response[Identify Effect Opportunity, Perform Due Diligence] | | |
Absence[Negotiate Terms] | |
Response[Negotiate Terms, Finalize Agreement] | | |
Precedence[Secure Funding, Perform Due Diligence] | | |
Chain Succession[Finalize Agreement, Execute Investment] | | |
Existence[Track Progress] | |
Response[Track Progress, Measure Effect] | | |
Precedence[Measure Effect, Document Effect] | | |0,7,d
Response[Document Effect, Exit Investment] | | |
Chain Succession[Exit Investment, Distribute Returns] | | |
Response[Distribute Returns, Assess Efficiency] | | |
End[Collect Response] | |
Response[Collect Response, Scheme Next Investment] | | |
Not Co-Existence[Finalize Agreement, Secure Funding] | | |